*** Keywords ***
Check BTS state and all RATs states
    [Arguments]             ${bts_type}=GNB
    Verify all RATs states                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Step                          Verifying BTS state..
    Verify BTS states                       bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                        BTS state and all RATs states are correct


Check selected BTS state and all RATs states
    [Documentation]  Checks selected BTS states and all RATs states.
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - bts_type (str): BTS type, GNB or ENB; defaults to GNB
    ...              - bts_statuses_to_check (list of str): list of BTS statuses to check, i.e.:
    ...                                                     ['operationalState', 'proceduralState'];
    ...                                                     defaults to None (default statuses will be checked:
    ...                                                     blockingState, operationalState, proceduralState)
    ...              - bts_status_variant (str): BTS status variant to check; available variants: OnAir, Test, Blocked,
    ...                                          Configured, NotComissioned, IntegratedToRan; defaults to OnAir.
    ...              - cells_blocked (bool): blocked cells; defaults to False
    [Arguments]             ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                     ${bts_statuses_to_check}=${None}
    ...                     ${bts_status_variant}=OnAir
    ...                     ${cells_blocked}=${False}
    Verify all RATs states                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                     cells_blocked=${cells_blocked}

    @{bts_statuses_to_check}=               Run Keyword If
    ...                                     """${bts_statuses_to_check}"""=='None'
    ...                                     Create List
    ...                                     blockingState      operationalState     proceduralState
    ...                                     ELSE
    ...                                     Set Variable
    ...                                     ${bts_statuses_to_check}

    Verify selected BTS states              bts_statuses_to_check=${bts_statuses_to_check}
    ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                     bts_status_variant=${bts_status_variant}
    Robot Log Result                        Selected BTS state and all RATs states are correct


