Verify All BBMODs Statuses and Their Resources with Impacted BBMODs and RMODs
    [Documentation]  Verifies statuses of all BBMOs and their resource components with impacted BBMODs and RMODs.
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - impacted_bbmod_ids (list of int/str): configuration IDs of impacted BBMODs
    ...              - impacted_bbmods_status_variant (str): status variant of impacted BBMODs
    ...              - impacted_rmods_ids (list of int/str): configuration IDs of impacted RMODs
    ...              - impacted_rmods_status_variant (str): status variant of impacted RMODs
    ...              - impacted_cells_status_variant (str): status variant of impacted cells
    ...              - connection (AdminConnection or str): AdminConnection object or if used, string name alias.
    ...              - bts_type (str): BTS type, GNB or ENB; defaults to GNB
    ...              - alternative_impacted_rmods_status_variant (str): alternative status variant of impacted RMODs, defaults to None
    ...                                                                 means that alternative status will not be checked in case of
    ...                                                                 incorrect impacted_rmods_status_variant.
    ...              - skip_cells_verification (bool): False if statuses of all cells should be checked, True otherwise.
    ...                                                Defaults to False.
    ...              - timeout_impacted_bbmod_status (int): timeout (in seconds) to achieve expected status for impacted bbmod, defaults to 5
    ...              - timeout_impacted_rmod_status (int): timeout (in seconds) to achieve expected status for impacted rmod, defaults to 30

    [Arguments]      ${impacted_bbmod_ids}
    ...              ${impacted_bbmods_status_variant}
    ...              ${impacted_rmods_ids}
    ...              ${impacted_rmods_status_variant}
    ...              ${impacted_cells_status_variant}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}
    ...              ${alternative_impacted_bbmods_status_variant}=${None}
    ...              ${alternative_impacted_rmods_status_variant}=${None}
    ...              ${skip_cells_verification}=${False}
    ...              ${timeout_impacted_bbmod_status}=5
    ...              ${timeout_impacted_rmod_status}=30

    ${all_bbmods_ids}                                      admin_info_model.get_bbmods_distnames
    ...                                                    connection=${connection}
    @{all_rmods_ids}                                       admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
    ...                                                    connection=${connection}

    ${impacted_bbmod_ids}                                  Priv Convert List of Str to List of Int
    ...                                                    ${impacted_bbmod_ids}
    ${impacted_rmods_ids}                                  Priv Convert List of Str to List of Int
    ...                                                    ${impacted_rmods_ids}

    Robot Log Operation                                    Verifying statuses of all components with impacted BBMODs, RMODs and Cells...

    FOR  ${impacted_bbmod_id}  IN  @{impacted_bbmod_ids}
      Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                          ${timeout_impacted_bbmod_status}    1
      ...    Verify Statuses of BBMOD
      ...                                                  bbmod_id=${impacted_bbmod_id}
      ...                                                  status_variant=${impacted_bbmods_status_variant}
      ...                                                  alternative_status_variant=${alternative_impacted_bbmods_status_variant}
      ...                                                  connection=${connection}
    END
    Robot Log Result                                       All impacted BBMODs have correct statuses.

    FOR  ${bbmod_id}  IN  @{all_bbmods_ids}
      Run keyword if                  ${bbmod_id} not in ${impacted_bbmod_ids}
      ...    Verify Statuses of BBMOD                      bbmod_id=${bbmod_id}
      ...                                                  status_variant=online
      ...                                                  connection=${connection}
    END
    Robot Log Result                                       All not impacted BBMODs have correct statuses.

    FOR  ${impacted_rmods_id}  IN  @{impacted_rmods_ids}
      Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                          ${timeout_impacted_rmod_status}    1
      ...    Priv Verify RMOD and Its Cells Statuses       rmod_id=${impacted_rmods_id}
      ...                                                  rmods_status_variant=${impacted_rmods_status_variant}
      ...                                                  alternative_rmods_status_variant=${alternative_impacted_rmods_status_variant}
      ...                                                  cells_status_variant=${impacted_cells_status_variant}
      ...                                                  skip_cells_verification=${skip_cells_verification}
      ...                                                  connection=${connection}
      ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    END
    Robot Log Result                                       All impacted RMODs and Its Cells have correct statuses.

    FOR  ${rmod_id}  IN  @{all_rmods_ids}
      Run keyword if                  ${rmod_id} not in ${impacted_rmods_ids}
      ...    Priv Verify RMOD and Its Cells Statuses       rmod_id=${rmod_id}
      ...                                                  rmods_status_variant=online
      ...                                                  cells_status_variant=online
      ...                                                  skip_cells_verification=${skip_cells_verification}
      ...                                                  connection=${connection}
      ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    END
    Robot Log Result                                       All not impacted RMODs and Its Cells have correct statuses.

Verify Statuses of BBMOD
    [Arguments]    ${bbmod_id}
    ...            ${status_variant}
    ...            ${connection}
